          "ts": "1772615520.000100",
          "iso": "2026-03-04T09:12:00Z",
          "user": "maya.okafor",
          "text": "Decision: every POST to /v1/charges and /v1/refunds must carry an Idempotency-Key header. We got bitten by double charges on client retries last quarter (INC-2026-014), so the API will reject requests without one.",
          "thread_ts": null,
          "reactions": [
            {
              "name": "white_check_mark",
              "count": 3
            }
          ],
          "permalink": "https://meridian-pay.slack.com/archives/C01PAYENG/p1772615520000100"
        },
        {
          "ts": "1772616000.000107",
          "iso": "2026-03-04T09:20:00Z",
          "user": "li.wei",
          "text": "+1. I'll write it up as PAY-118 and take the implementation.",
          "thread_ts": "1772615520.000100",
          "reactions": [],
          "permalink": "https://meridian-pay.slack.com/archives/C01PAYENG/p1772616000000107"
        },
        {
          "ts": "1773070800.000114",
          "iso": "2026-03-09T15:40:00Z",
          "user": "tomas.rivera",
          "text": "Reminder for anyone adding endpoints: all amounts are integers in minor units (cents). No floats, no decimal strings. The ledger enforces it with a CHECK constraint so bad values blow up loudly.",
          "thread_ts": null,
          "reactions": [
            {
              "name": "thumbsup",
              "count": 2
            }
          ],
          "permalink": "https://meridian-pay.slack.com/archives/C01PAYENG/p1773070800000114"
        },
        {
          "ts": "1773309600.000121",
          "iso": "2026-03-12T10:00:00Z",
          "user": "maya.okafor",
          "text": "Reminder: payments-service deploys to prod on Thursdays only (release train, 2pm UTC). Anything merged after Wednesday EOD rides the next train. Hotfixes outside the train need Rachel's sign-off.",
          "thread_ts": null,
          "reactions": [
            {
              "name": "thumbsup",
              "count": 3
            }
          ],
          "permalink": "https://meridian-pay.slack.com/archives/C01PAYENG/p1773309600000121"
        },
        {
          "ts": "1776159000.000128",
          "iso": "2026-04-14T09:30:00Z",
          "user": "maya.okafor",
          "text": "Decision: we're moving API rate limiting to Redis with a sliding-window counter. In-process counters fall apart the moment we run more than one pod, and Brightcart is about to ramp up traffic.",
          "thread_ts": null,
          "reactions": [
            {
              "name": "thumbsup",
              "count": 4
            },
            {
              "name": "rocket",
              "count": 1
            }
          ],
          "permalink": "https://meridian-pay.slack.com/archives/C01PAYENG/p1776159000000128"
        },
        {
          "ts": "1776159660.000135",
          "iso": "2026-04-14T09:41:00Z",
          "user": "tomas.rivera",
          "text": "Agreed. I'll sketch the key schema this week.",
          "thread_ts": "1776159000.000128",
          "reactions": [],
          "permalink": "https://meridian-pay.slack.com/archives/C01PAYENG/p1776159660000135"
        },
        {
